    <section class="about-hero">
        <div class="about-hero-copy">
            <p class="about-kicker">Pokhara, Nepal</p>
            <h1 class="about-title">Connecting Gandaki farmers with households that value fresh, ethical food.</h1>
            <p class="about-lead">Farm2Home is a modern agricultural e-commerce platform that helps local producers bring organic and responsibly grown products directly to customers through a trusted farm-to-table marketplace.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-hero-card">
            <h2 class="about-card-title">Why Farm2Home exists</h2>
            <p class="about-card-text">We believe small and medium-scale farmers deserve better digital access to markets, while families deserve easier access to transparent, healthy, and locally sourced food.</p>
