    <section class="about-grid">
        <section class="about-card">
            <h2 class="about-section-title">Introduction</h2>
            <p class="about-section-text">Farm2Home is an agriculture-focused digital marketplace based in Pokhara, Nepal, with a strong commitment to supporting farming communities across Gandaki Province. Our platform helps customers discover seasonal produce, dairy, grains, and spices while building a more direct connection with the people who grow and prepare these goods.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-card">
            <h2 class="about-section-title">Mission</h2>
            <p class="about-section-text">Our mission is to create a reliable and transparent bridge between local farmers and consumers by making fresh, sustainable products easier to access through digital commerce.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-card">
            <h2 class="about-section-title">Vision</h2>
            <p class="about-section-text">Our vision is to become a trusted farm-to-home ecosystem that strengthens regional agriculture, improves market access for farmers, and inspires healthier, more conscious food choices.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-card">
            <h2 class="about-section-title">Core Values</h2>
            <ul class="about-values">
                <li>Fair access to markets for local farmers</li>
                <li>Fresh, transparent, and responsibly sourced products</li>
                <li>Digital innovation for agricultural growth</li>
                <li>Respect for sustainability and community wellbeing</li>
                <li>Trust, traceability, and customer confidence</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="about-card about-card-wide">
            <h2 class="about-section-title">How Farm2Home Works</h2>
            <p class="about-section-text">Customers can browse products by category, review item details, and place orders through a simple online shopping flow. On the operational side, the Farm2Home team manages products, availability, users, and order activity to ensure that the platform stays accurate, responsive, and dependable for both customers and producers.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-card">
            <h2 class="about-section-title">Ethical Commitment</h2>
            <p class="about-section-text">Farm2Home is built around responsible sourcing and local empowerment. By helping reduce dependency on long supply chains and unnecessary intermediaries, we contribute to a more sustainable food system that values farmers, freshness, and environmental responsibility.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-card">
            <h2 class="about-section-title">Future Goals</h2>
            <p class="about-section-text">We aim to expand Farm2Home with a mobile application, integrated online payment gateway, and real-time inventory updates so the platform can offer a smoother and more scalable experience for the growing digital agriculture market.</p>
        </section>
    </section>
